        "content": "<p>myunbin opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14697\">PR #14697</a> from <code>myunbin:add-rules-261013</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Add mid-end optimization rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>sextend(x) OP sextend(y) --&gt; x OP y</code>, where <code>OP = {!=, &gt;=s, &lt;=s, &gt;=u, &gt;u, &lt;=u, &lt;u}</code></li>\n<li><code>uextend(x) OP uextend(y) --&gt; x OP y</code>, where <code>OP = {!=, &gt;=u, &lt;=u}</code></li>\n<li><code>uextend(x) OPs uextend(y) --&gt; x OPu y</code>, where <code>OP = {&gt;=, &gt;, &lt;=, &lt;}</code></li>\n<li><code>(x != 0) | (y != 0) --&gt; (x | y) != 0</code></li>\n<li><code>(x == 0) &amp; (y == 0) --&gt; (x | y) == 0</code></li>\n<li><code>select(c, C1, C2) OP C --&gt; select(c, C1 OP C, C2 OP C)</code>, where <code>OP = {|, ^, -}</code></li>\n<li><code>C - select(c, C1, C2) --&gt; select(c, C - C1, C - C2)</code></li>\n<li><code>(x &gt;&gt; k) OP (y &gt;&gt; k) --&gt; (x OP y) &gt;&gt; k</code>, where <code>OP = {&amp;, |}</code></li>\n<li><code>(x &gt;&gt;s k) &amp; (y &gt;&gt;u k) --&gt; (x &amp; y) &gt;&gt;u k</code></li>\n<li><code>((x &amp; M) &lt;&lt; k) &amp; M --&gt; (x &lt;&lt; k) &amp; M</code>, where <code>M = 2^n − 1</code></li>\n<li><code>~x &amp; (x | y) --&gt; ~x &amp; y</code></li>\n<li><code>~x ^ C --&gt; x ^ ~C</code></li>\n<li><code>~(x &amp; y) &amp; (x | y) --&gt; x ^ y</code></li>\n<li><code>~(x &amp; y) | x --&gt; -1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>and revised some annotations.<br>\nThanks!<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
